  "description": "Enterprise documentation and business flow management framework for .NET applications. Provides a plug-and-play documentation portal, business flow tracking, versioning, file attachments, Markdown/HTML content, full-text search, and an embedded enterprise dashboard with dark mode. Built by Muhammad Rehman Tahir.",
